# Scaffold-ETH & Monad Blitz Development Rules

- **Framework Standard**: Scaffold-ETH 2 specification for EVM dApps with Monad Testnet integration.
- **Chain Targeting**: Monad Testnet (Chain ID: 10143, RPC: https://testnet-rpc.monad.xyz).
- **Parallel EVM Concurrency**:
  - Eliminate global storage collisions (no monotonic counters like nextTokenId++ or totalCount++).
  - Use deterministic salt/hash-based token identifiers for conflict-free parallel state commits.
  - Rely on contract event streaming for off-chain indexing (Envio HyperIndex / Substreams).
- **Monad Gas Rules**:
  - Base fee >= 52 gwei (default minimum 50 gwei).
  - Monad charges on full gas_limit, not just gas used. Keep gas limits tight and accurate.
  - Maintain wallet balance above the 10 MON reserve floor to avoid consensus-level queuing delays.
- **Deployment & Production**:
  - Frontend hosted on Vercel with zero build friction (single-page static delivery).
  - Public GitHub repository with one-click deploy workflows.
